exports[`App layouts render > DM view 1`] = `"<div class="app-shell"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-brand"><span class="topbar-brand-badge" style="display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; line-height: 1.05; gap: 1px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span class="topbar-brand-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>SIDEREROLL</span><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 9px; opacity: 0.72; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding-left: 14px;">[VERSION]</span></span><select aria-label="Active campaign" style="background: var(--bg-base); color: var(--text-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"><option value="camp-default-01">The Shattered Crown (4 notes)</option></select><button type="button" class="btn" title="Manage Party Characters, Import PDFs, or Open a Sheet">Party (1)</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" title="Build &amp; Launch Encounters">Encounter Forge</button></div><div class="topbar-center"><div class="mode-switcher" role="group" aria-label="DM Workspace View"><button type="button" class="mode-switcher-btn active" aria-pressed="true">DM Studio</button><button type="button" class="mode-switcher-btn " aria-pressed="false">Tactical Battlemap</button></div></div><div class="topbar-actions"><div class="mode-switcher" role="group" aria-label="Table role"><button type="button" class="mode-switcher-btn active" aria-pressed="true" title="DM View: full encounter, monster, and campaign controls">DM</button><button type="button" class="mode-switcher-btn " aria-pressed="false" title="Player View: sheet, dice, and your own token only (hides monster tools)">Player</button></div><button type="button" class="btn" title="Open Theme Studio, Custom Theme Editor &amp; Setup Sharing">Themes</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="View 2014 vs 2024 rule differences &amp; customize house rules">Rules: 2024</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Compendium, Packs &amp; PDF Import (Ctrl+K)">Packs (Ctrl+K)</button><button type="button" class="btn">DM Hub</button><button type="button" class="btn">Battlemap</button><button type="button" class="btn ">Live Table</button><button type="button" class="btn" disabled="" title="Undo (Ctrl+Z)" aria-label="Undo"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 14 4 9 9 4"></polyline><path d="M20 20v-7a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H4"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="btn" disabled="" title="Redo (Ctrl+Y)" aria-label="Redo"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="15 14 20 9 15 4"></polyline><path d="M4 20v-7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h12"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Keyboard Shortcuts &amp; Tips">?</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Settings &amp; Theme"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9c.26.6.77 1.02 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="subpanel forge-row" style="padding: 5px 14px; margin: 6px 14px 0px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; flex-shrink: 0;" aria-label="DM Party Live Status Strip"><span class="muted-label">PARTY VITALS</span><span class="badge tabular"><strong>Armorer Artificer</strong> • HP 76/76 • AC 21</span></div><div class="dm-workspace-grid"><nav class="dm-left-rail" aria-label="DM Studio navigation"><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn active"><span>Party &amp; Sync</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Campaign Binder</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>World Clock</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Loot &amp; Shops</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>DM Screen</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Party XP &amp; Milestones</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Improv</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>World Map</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Soundboard</span></button><button type="button" class="unified-rail-btn "><span>Tactical Battlemap</span></button><hr style="width: 100%; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); margin: 6px 0px;"><div class="forge-section-label" style="padding-left: 4px; margin-bottom: 2px;">PARTY (1)</div><div class="dm-party-mini-card"><div class="forge-row-between" style="gap: 4px;"><strong style="font-size: 12px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">Armorer Artificer</strong><span class="badge tabular">AC 21</span></div><div class="forge-row-between tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;"><span>HP 76/76</span><span>PP 15</span></div><button type="button" class="btn" style="width: 100%; font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 6px;">Open Sheet</button></div></nav><main class="dm-center-stage"><div class="forge-stack"><div class="card forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;"><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><select aria-label="Active campaign" class="forge-input" style="font-weight: 700;"><option value="camp-default-01">The Shattered Crown (4 notes)</option></select><input aria-label="New campaign name" class="forge-input" placeholder="New campaign name..." style="width: 170px;" type="text" value=""><button type="button" class="btn">+ New Campaign</button></div><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><span class="tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 12px;">Day 1 • 08:00 • Clear Skies</span><button type="button" class="btn">Export .md</button><button type="button" class="btn">Print Session Packet</button></div></div><div class="forge-stack"><div class="forge-stack"><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><span class="forge-section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">PARTY CHEAT SHEET (1 PCs)</span><span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Passive Perception, Insight, AC, HP &amp; Spell Save DC at a glance</span></div><div style="overflow-x: auto;"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;"><thead><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); text-align: left; color: var(--text-secondary);"><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">Character</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">AC</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">HP</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">Pass. Perc</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">Pass. Insight</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">Spell DC</th><th style="padding: 4px 6px;">Sheet</th></tr></thead><tbody class="tabular"><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);"><td style="padding: 5px 6px;"><strong>Armorer Artificer</strong> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Artificer 9)</span></td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;">21</td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;">76/76</td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;">15</td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;">11</td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;">17</td><td style="padding: 5px 6px;"><button type="button" class="btn">Open Sheet</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><span class="forge-section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">ONE-CLICK LIVE TABLE ROLL PROMPTS</span><label class="forge-row" style="gap: 6px; font-size: 11px;"><span class="forge-muted">DC:</span><input class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 58px; padding: 2px 6px;" type="number" value="12"></label></div><div class="pill-row"><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: Perception Check</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: Stealth Check</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: Insight Check</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: Investigation Check</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: CON Save</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: DEX Save</button><button type="button" class="btn">Prompt: WIS Save</button></div></div><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><span class="forge-section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">EXTERNAL GITHUB REPO (<code>campaign-pack.json</code>)</span></div><div class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 12px;">Link a GitHub repo (<code>owner/repo</code>) for this campaign's binder entries, custom DLC, and characters. Use Pack Path to keep multiple campaigns in one shared repo.</div><form class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><input class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 180px;" placeholder="Solopass/dnd-campaign-vault" type="text" value="" name="repoSlug"><input class="forge-input" style="width: 80px;" placeholder="main" type="text" value="main" name="repoBranch"><input class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 170px;" placeholder="campaign-pack.json" title="Manifest path inside the repo (e.g. campaign-pack.json or campaigns/strahd/campaign-pack.json)" type="text" value="campaign-pack.json" name="repoPath"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Sync Repo</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Pull native Free5e Markdown spells &amp; feats directly from Solopass/free5e">Sync Solopass/free5e</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Commit this campaign's binder entries and custom DLC back to GitHub (requires PAT in Settings)">Push Pack</button><button type="button" class="btn">Template</button></form></div></div></div></div></main><aside class="pane" aria-label="Encounter and Linked Summons"><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between"><select aria-label="Active encounter" class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 6px;"><option value="enc-01">Active Combat</option></select><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" title="Create new encounter">+ New</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Duplicate current encounter">Dup</button></div></div><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><div class="tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Round 1 • 1 Combatants</div><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" title="Flash Roll Initiative alert and play sound on all connected players' browsers">Start! (Roll Init)</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Drop all saved PCs into encounter">+ Party</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Roll 1d20 + DEX for all combatants">Roll All Init</button><button type="button" class="pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Toggle Player View (hides monster HP and ambushers)">DM View</button><button type="button" class="btn">Battlemap</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Clear monsters/summons and reset to Round 1">Reset</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Next Turn</button></div></div></div><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">ENCOUNTER CONTROLS</div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="pill ">+ Add Creature</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Builder / Forge</button></div></div><button type="button" class="btn">Quick Demo: Spawn 2× Goblin</button></div><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between"><div class="forge-section-label" style="color: var(--accent-amber);">ACTIVE EFFECTS &amp; TIMERS (0)</div><button type="button" class="pill ">+ Timer</button></div></div><div class="card combatant-active" style="margin-left: 0px; opacity: 1;"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><input aria-label="Armorer Artificer initiative" title="Initiative" class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 38px; padding: 1px 4px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;" type="number" value="16"><strong>Armorer Artificer</strong><span class="turn-badge">TURN</span><span class="tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">AC 21</span></span><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;"><button type="button" class="pill " title="Select as attack/spell target">Target</button><button type="button" class="pill active" title="Collapse combatant controls">Less</button></div></div><div class="forge-row-between" style="margin-top: 6px; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 12px;">HP <strong>76</strong> / 76 (+9)</span><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 4px;"><div class="econ-pill-row" role="group" aria-label="Armorer Artificer turn economy"><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Action: Available (click to toggle)">A</button><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Bonus Action: Available (click to toggle)">BA</button><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Reaction: Available (click to toggle)">R</button></div><button type="button" class="btn">-5</button><button type="button" class="btn">-1</button><button type="button" class="btn">+5</button></div></div><div class="hp-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hp-bar-fill hp-high" style="width: 100%;"></div></div><div class="forge-stack" style="margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); gap: 6px;"><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;"><button type="button" class="btn" aria-label="Move Armorer Artificer up in initiative" title="Move up in turn order">↑</button><button type="button" class="btn" aria-label="Move Armorer Artificer down in initiative" title="Move down in turn order">↓</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" style="margin-left: auto;" title="Remove from encounter" aria-label="Remove Armorer Artificer">Remove</button></div><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 4px;"><input aria-label="Armorer Artificer HP delta" min="1" placeholder="Amt (Enter=Dmg)" class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 92px; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;" type="number" value=""><button type="button" class="btn btn-danger">Dmg</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Heal</button><select aria-label="Armorer Artificer condition" class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 0%; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;"><option value="Blinded">Blinded</option><option value="Charmed">Charmed</option><option value="Deafened">Deafened</option><option value="Frightened">Frightened</option><option value="Grappled">Grappled</option><option value="Incapacitated">Incapacitated</option><option value="Invisible">Invisible</option><option value="Paralyzed">Paralyzed</option><option value="Petrified">Petrified</option><option value="Poisoned">Poisoned</option><option value="Prone">Prone</option><option value="Restrained">Restrained</option><option value="Stunned">Stunned</option><option value="Unconscious">Unconscious</option></select><button type="button" class="btn">+Cond</button></div></div></div></aside></div><footer class="status-console-shell"><div class="status-console-bar"><form class="forge-row"><label for="dice-console-input" class="forge-label" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 21 7 21 17 12 22 3 17 3 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="3 7 12 12 21 7"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg> DICE TRAY</label><input id="dice-console-input" placeholder="2d6+4, 4d6kh3, 1d20+9..." class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 190px; padding: 3px 8px;" type="text" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand">Roll</button></form><div class="dice-tray" aria-label="Quick dice tray"><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d4</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d6</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d8</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d10</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d12</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d20</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d100</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Advantage">d20 Adv</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Disadvantage">d20 Dis</button></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn">Clear</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Cycle console height (normal / expanded / collapsed)">Expand</button></div></div><div class="status-console-log" aria-live="polite"><div style="color: var(--text-secondary);">[TIME] Sidereroll v0.7 ready. Press Ctrl+K for Compendium Packs, D&amp;D Beyond PDF Import, or JSON/Markdown ingestion.</div></div></footer><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id0_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id1_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id2_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id3_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id4_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id5_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id6_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id7_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id8_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id9_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id10_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id11_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id12_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id13_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id14_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id15_" closedby="any"></dialog><div class="toast-region" role="region" aria-label="Notifications"><p class="sr-only">Screen reader notifications</p><div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div></div><section class="print-session-packet" aria-hidden="true"><h1>The Shattered Crown — Session Prep Packet</h1><p>Setting: Sword Coast &amp; Borderlands • Day 1, 08:00 (Clear Skies)</p><h2>Active Character: Armorer Artificer</h2><p>Human • Artificer 9 • Lvl 9 • AC 21 • HP 76/76 • Walk 30ft</p><h2>Campaign Binder (4 Entries)</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[SESSION] Session 1 — Road to Oakhaven</strong> — Met patron Gundren at the tavern and cleared a goblin ambush.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">The party escorted the supply wagon south along the High Road. Discovered a black seal stamped on the ambushers’ arrows.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[NPC] Sister Linene Vael</strong> — Temple curator and local quest giver in Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Friendly cleric of light. Pays 150 GP for recovering stolen temple relics from the sunken vault.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[LOCATION] Sunken Vault of Thornwatch</strong> — Flooded keep two days east of Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Guarded by skeletons and a gelatinous cube in the lower cistern. Secret door behind the altar (DC 15 Investigation).</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[QUEST] Recover the Sun Chalice</strong> — Retrieve the relic before the next full moon.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Reward: 250 GP + Potion of Greater Healing.</div></div><h2>Active Encounter: Active Combat (Round 1)</h2><ul><li>Armorer Artificer — Init 16, AC 21, HP 76/76</li></ul></section></div>"`;

