tyle="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 21 7 21 17 12 22 3 17 3 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="3 7 12 12 21 7"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg> DICE TRAY</label><input id="dice-console-input" placeholder="2d6+4, 4d6kh3, 1d20+9..." class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 190px; padding: 3px 8px;" type="text" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand">Roll</button></form><div class="dice-tray" aria-label="Quick dice tray"><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d4</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d6</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d8</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d10</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d12</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d20</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d100</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Advantage">d20 Adv</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Disadvantage">d20 Dis</button></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn">Clear</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Cycle console height (normal / expanded / collapsed)">Expand</button></div></div><div class="status-console-log" aria-live="polite"><div style="color: var(--text-secondary);">[TIME] Sidereroll v0.7 ready. Press Ctrl+K for Compendium Packs, D&amp;D Beyond PDF Import, or JSON/Markdown ingestion.</div></div></footer><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id0_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id1_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id2_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id3_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id4_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id5_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id6_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id7_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id8_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id9_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id10_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id11_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id12_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id13_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id14_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id15_" closedby="any"></dialog><div class="toast-region" role="region" aria-label="Notifications"><p class="sr-only">Screen reader notifications</p><div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div></div><section class="print-session-packet" aria-hidden="true"><h1>The Shattered Crown — Session Prep Packet</h1><p>Setting: Sword Coast &amp; Borderlands • Day 1, 08:00 (Clear Skies)</p><h2>Active Character: Armorer Artificer</h2><p>Human • Artificer 9 • Lvl 9 • AC 21 • HP 76/76 • Walk 30ft</p><h2>Campaign Binder (4 Entries)</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[SESSION] Session 1 — Road to Oakhaven</strong> — Met patron Gundren at the tavern and cleared a goblin ambush.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">The party escorted the supply wagon south along the High Road. Discovered a black seal stamped on the ambushers’ arrows.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[NPC] Sister Linene Vael</strong> — Temple curator and local quest giver in Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Friendly cleric of light. Pays 150 GP for recovering stolen temple relics from the sunken vault.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[LOCATION] Sunken Vault of Thornwatch</strong> — Flooded keep two days east of Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Guarded by skeletons and a gelatinous cube in the lower cistern. Secret door behind the altar (DC 15 Investigation).</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[QUEST] Recover the Sun Chalice</strong> — Retrieve the relic before the next full moon.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Reward: 250 GP + Potion of Greater Healing.</div></div><h2>Active Encounter: Active Combat (Round 1)</h2><ul><li>Armorer Artificer — Init 16, AC 21, HP 76/76</li></ul></section></div>"`;

