"region" aria-label="Notifications"><p class="sr-only">Screen reader notifications</p><div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div></div><section class="print-session-packet" aria-hidden="true"><h1>The Shattered Crown — Session Prep Packet</h1><p>Setting: Sword Coast &amp; Borderlands • Day 1, 08:00 (Clear Skies)</p><h2>Active Character: Armorer Artificer</h2><p>Human • Artificer 9 • Lvl 9 • AC 21 • HP 76/76 • Walk 30ft</p><h2>Campaign Binder (4 Entries)</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[SESSION] Session 1 — Road to Oakhaven</strong> — Met patron Gundren at the tavern and cleared a goblin ambush.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">The party escorted the supply wagon south along the High Road. Discovered a black seal stamped on the ambushers’ arrows.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[NPC] Sister Linene Vael</strong> — Temple curator and local quest giver in Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Friendly cleric of light. Pays 150 GP for recovering stolen temple relics from the sunken vault.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[LOCATION] Sunken Vault of Thornwatch</strong> — Flooded keep two days east of Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Guarded by skeletons and a gelatinous cube in the lower cistern. Secret door behind the altar (DC 15 Investigation).</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[QUEST] Recover the Sun Chalice</strong> — Retrieve the relic before the next full moon.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Reward: 250 GP + Potion of Greater Healing.</div></div><h2>Active Encounter: Active Combat (Round 1)</h2><ul><li>Armorer Artificer — Init 16, AC 21, HP 76/76</li></ul></section></div>"`;

