Thunder Gauntlets</strong> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 10px;">WEAPON</span></div><div class="pill-row" style="align-items: center;"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 10px;">-</button><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 11px;">×1</span><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 10px;">+</button><select aria-label="Guardian Thunder Gauntlets container" class="forge-input" style="padding: 1px 4px; font-size: 10px; width: 78px;"><option value="">Carried</option><option value="Backpack">Backpack</option><option value="Bag of Holding">Bag of Holding</option><option value="Pouch">Pouch</option></select><button type="button" class="pill active">Eq</button><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 10px;" title="Send 1 to Party Shared Inventory">→ Party</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-accent="default" class="widget-frame height-compact  " style="grid-column: span 4;" draggable="false"><div class="widget-toolbar"><div class="widget-drag-handle"><span>PARTY SHARED INVENTORY</span></div></div><div class="widget-body"><div class="forge-stack"><div class="forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Shared across party • Claiming moves 1 to <strong>Armorer Artificer</strong></span><span class="badge tabular">Party Gold: 120 GP</span></div><form class="forge-row" style="gap: 6px;"><input class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 0%;" placeholder="Add shared item (e.g. Potion of Healing, Rope)..." type="text" value=""><input min="1" class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 52px;" type="number" value="1"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">+ Stash</button></form><div class="forge-stack" style="max-height: 240px; overflow-y: auto;"><div class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 12px;">Party Shared Inventory is empty. Deposit items from your inventory or add shared loot above.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-accent="default" class="widget-frame height-compact  " style="grid-column: span 6;" draggable="false"><div class="widget-toolbar"><div class="widget-drag-handle"><span>FEATURES &amp; NOTES</span></div></div><div class="widget-body"><div class="forge-stack"><div class="subpanel" style="padding: 6px 8px;"><strong style="font-size: 12px;">Arcane Armor (Guardian)</strong><div class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Your armor removes STR requirements, serves as a spellcasting focus, and deploys Thunder Gauntlets.</div></div><div class="subpanel" style="padding: 6px 8px;"><strong style="font-size: 12px;">Extra Attack</strong><div class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">You can attack twice, rather than once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.</div></div><div class="subpanel" style="padding: 6px 8px;"><strong style="font-size: 12px;">Flash of Genius</strong><div class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Reaction: Add your INT modifier (+5) to an ability check or saving throw within 30 ft.</div></div></div></div></section></div></div><footer class="status-console-shell"><div class="status-console-bar"><form class="forge-row"><label for="dice-console-input" class="forge-label" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 21 7 21 17 12 22 3 17 3 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="3 7 12 12 21 7"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg> DICE TRAY</label><input id="dice-console-input" placeholder="2d6+4, 4d6kh3, 1d20+9..." class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 190px; padding: 3px 8px;" type="text" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand">Roll</button></form><div class="dice-tray" aria-label="Quick dice tray"><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d4</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d6</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d8</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d10</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d12</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d20</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d100</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Advantage">d20 Adv</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Disadvantage">d20 Dis</button></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn">Clear</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Cycle console height (normal / expanded / collapsed)">Expand</button></div></div><div class="status-console-log" aria-live="polite"><div style="color: var(--text-secondary);">[TIME] Sidereroll v0.7 ready. Press Ctrl+K for Compendium Packs, D&amp;D Beyond PDF Import, or JSON/Markdown ingestion.</div></div></footer><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id0_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id1_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id2_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id3_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id4_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id5_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id6_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id7_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id8_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id9_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id10_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id11_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id12_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id13_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id14_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id15_" closedby="any"></dialog><div class="toast-region" role="region" aria-label="Notifications"><p class="sr-only">Screen reader notifications</p><div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div></div><section class="print-session-packet" aria-hidden="true"><h1>The Shattered Crown — Session Prep Packet</h1><p>Setting: Sword Coast &amp; Borderlands • Day 1, 08:00 (Clear Skies)</p><h2>Active Character: Armorer Artificer</h2><p>Human • Artificer 9 • Lvl 9 • AC 21 • HP 76/76 • Walk 30ft</p><h2>Campaign Binder (4 Entries)</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[SESSION] Session 1 — Road to Oakhaven</strong> — Met patron Gundren at the tavern and cleared a goblin ambush.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">The party escorted the supply wagon south along the High Road. Discovered a black seal stamped on the ambushers’ arrows.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[NPC] Sister Linene Vael</strong> — Temple curator and local quest giver in Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Friendly cleric of light. Pays 150 GP for recovering stolen temple relics from the sunken vault.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[LOCATION] Sunken Vault of Thornwatch</strong> — Flooded keep two days east of Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Guarded by skeletons and a gelatinous cube in the lower cistern. Secret door behind the altar (DC 15 Investigation).</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[QUEST] Recover the Sun Chalice</strong> — Retrieve the relic before the next full moon.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Reward: 250 GP + Potion of Greater Healing.</div></div><h2>Active Encounter: Active Combat (Round 1)</h2><ul><li>Armorer Artificer — Init 16, AC 21, HP 76/76</li></ul></section></div>"`;

