17"></rect><rect x="109.8" y="140" width="30.400000000000002" height="4" rx="2" fill="#3fb950"></rect></g></svg></div></div></div><main class="pane" aria-label="Action Economy Dashboard"><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><div class="pill-row"><button type="button" class="pill active">ALL</button><button type="button" class="pill ">ATTACK</button><button type="button" class="pill ">SAVE</button><button type="button" class="pill ">HEAL</button><button type="button" class="pill ">SUMMON</button><button type="button" class="pill ">CONC</button></div><div class="pill-row"><button type="button" class="pill ">DIS</button><button type="button" class="pill active">FLAT</button><button type="button" class="pill ">ADV</button></div></div><input aria-label="Filter actions and spells" class="forge-input" placeholder="Filter actions, spells, features..." type="text" value=""><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 6px;"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;">+ Add Spell</button><button type="button" class="btn" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;">+ Add Gear</button></div><div class="pill-row" aria-label="Combat buff toggles"><button type="button" class="pill " title="Add +1d4 to attack rolls">Bless +1d4</button></div></div></div><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">ACTIONS (2)</div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Thunder Gauntlets</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Guardian Thunder Gauntlets)</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Deals </span><button type="button" class="inline-tag-btn">1d8+5</button><span> thunder damage; target has disadvantage against others.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Thunder Gauntlets">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">+9 / 1d8 + 5</button></div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Cast Summon Construct</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Summon Construct)</span><span class="conc-badge">CONC</span><span class="cost-badge">3rd Slot</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Spawns a linked Construct companion immediately after your initiative.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Cast Summon Construct">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">Summon</button></div></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">BONUS ACTIONS (1)</div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Defensive Field</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Guardian Thunder Gauntlets)</span><span class="cost-badge">Defensive Field</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Gain temporary HP equal to your Artificer level.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Defensive Field">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">Use</button></div></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">REACTIONS (0)</div></div><div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;">No matching actions.</div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">FREE &amp; SPECIAL (0)</div></div><div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;">No matching actions.</div></section></main></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; min-height: 0;"><div class="subpanel forge-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Right panel tabs" style="padding: 4px 8px; gap: 6px; margin: 8px 10px 0px; flex-shrink: 0;"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="pill active">Combat (1)</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="pill ">Inspector</button></div><aside class="pane" aria-label="Encounter and Linked Summons"><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between"><select aria-label="Active encounter" class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 6px;"><option value="enc-01">Active Combat</option></select><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" title="Create new encounter">+ New</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Duplicate current encounter">Dup</button></div></div><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"><div class="tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">Round 1 • 1 Combatants</div><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap;"></div></div></div><div class="card forge-stack"><div class="forge-row-between"><div class="forge-section-label" style="color: var(--accent-amber);">ACTIVE EFFECTS &amp; TIMERS (0)</div></div></div><div class="card combatant-active" style="margin-left: 0px; opacity: 1;"><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><input aria-label="Armorer Artificer initiative" title="Initiative" class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 38px; padding: 1px 4px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;" type="number" value="16"><strong>Armorer Artificer</strong><span class="turn-badge">TURN</span><span class="tabular forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">AC 21</span></span><div class="forge-row" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;"><button type="button" class="pill active" title="Collapse combatant controls">Less</button></div></div><div class="forge-row-between" style="margin-top: 6px; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 12px;">HP <strong>76</strong> / 76 (+9)</span><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 4px;"><div class="econ-pill-row" role="group" aria-label="Armorer Artificer turn economy"><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Action: Available (click to toggle)">A</button><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Bonus Action: Available (click to toggle)">BA</button><button type="button" class="econ-pill " aria-pressed="false" title="Reaction: Available (click to toggle)">R</button></div><button type="button" class="btn">-5</button><button type="button" class="btn">-1</button><button type="button" class="btn">+5</button></div></div><div class="hp-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hp-bar-fill hp-high" style="width: 100%;"></div></div><div class="forge-stack" style="margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); gap: 6px;"><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 4px;"><input aria-label="Armorer Artificer HP delta" min="1" placeholder="Amt (Enter=Dmg)" class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 92px; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;" type="number" value=""><button type="button" class="btn btn-danger">Dmg</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Heal</button><select aria-label="Armorer Artificer condition" class="forge-input" style="flex: 1 1 0%; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;"><option value="Blinded">Blinded</option><option value="Charmed">Charmed</option><option value="Deafened">Deafened</option><option value="Frightened">Frightened</option><option value="Grappled">Grappled</option><option value="Incapacitated">Incapacitated</option><option value="Invisible">Invisible</option><option value="Paralyzed">Paralyzed</option><option value="Petrified">Petrified</option><option value="Poisoned">Poisoned</option><option value="Prone">Prone</option><option value="Restrained">Restrained</option><option value="Stunned">Stunned</option><option value="Unconscious">Unconscious</option></select><button type="button" class="btn">+Cond</button></div></div></div></aside></div></div></div><footer class="status-console-shell"><div class="status-console-bar"><form class="forge-row"><label for="dice-console-input" class="forge-label" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 21 7 21 17 12 22 3 17 3 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="3 7 12 12 21 7"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg> DICE TRAY</label><input id="dice-console-input" placeholder="2d6+4, 4d6kh3, 1d20+9..." class="forge-input tabular" style="width: 190px; padding: 3px 8px;" type="text" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand">Roll</button></form><div class="dice-tray" aria-label="Quick dice tray"><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d4</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d6</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d8</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d10</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d12</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d20</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular">d100</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Advantage">d20 Adv</button><button type="button" class="btn tabular" title="Roll d20 with Disadvantage">d20 Dis</button></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn">Clear</button><button type="button" class="btn" title="Cycle console height (normal / expanded / collapsed)">Expand</button></div></div><div class="status-console-log" aria-live="polite"><div style="color: var(--text-secondary);">[TIME] Sidereroll v0.7 ready. Press Ctrl+K for Compendium Packs, D&amp;D Beyond PDF Import, or JSON/Markdown ingestion.</div></div></footer><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id0_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id1_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id2_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id3_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id4_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id5_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id6_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id7_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id8_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id9_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id10_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id11_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id12_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id13_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog forge-dialog-wide" aria-labelledby="_id14_" closedby="any"></dialog><dialog class="forge-dialog" aria-labelledby="_id15_" closedby="any"></dialog><div class="toast-region" role="region" aria-label="Notifications"><p class="sr-only">Screen reader notifications</p><div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div></div><section class="print-session-packet" aria-hidden="true"><h1>The Shattered Crown — Session Prep Packet</h1><p>Setting: Sword Coast &amp; Borderlands • Day 1, 08:00 (Clear Skies)</p><h2>Active Character: Armorer Artificer</h2><p>Human • Artificer 9 • Lvl 9 • AC 21 • HP 76/76 • Walk 30ft</p><h2>Campaign Binder (4 Entries)</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[SESSION] Session 1 — Road to Oakhaven</strong> — Met patron Gundren at the tavern and cleared a goblin ambush.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">The party escorted the supply wagon south along the High Road. Discovered a black seal stamped on the ambushers’ arrows.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[NPC] Sister Linene Vael</strong> — Temple curator and local quest giver in Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Friendly cleric of light. Pays 150 GP for recovering stolen temple relics from the sunken vault.</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[LOCATION] Sunken Vault of Thornwatch</strong> — Flooded keep two days east of Oakhaven.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Guarded by skeletons and a gelatinous cube in the lower cistern. Secret door behind the altar (DC 15 Investigation).</div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-bottom: 6px;"><strong>[QUEST] Recover the Sun Chalice</strong> — Retrieve the relic before the next full moon.<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px;">Reward: 250 GP + Potion of Greater Healing.</div></div><h2>Active Encounter: Active Combat (Round 1)</h2><ul><li>Armorer Artificer — Init 16, AC 21, HP 76/76</li></ul></section></div>"`;

