button></div></div><input aria-label="Filter actions and spells" class="forge-input" placeholder="Filter actions, spells, features..." type="text" value=""><div class="forge-row-between" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><div class="forge-row" style="gap: 6px;"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;">+ Add Spell</button><button type="button" class="btn" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;">+ Add Gear</button></div><div class="pill-row" aria-label="Combat buff toggles"><button type="button" class="pill " title="Add +1d4 to attack rolls">Bless +1d4</button></div></div></div><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">ACTIONS (2)</div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Thunder Gauntlets</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Guardian Thunder Gauntlets)</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Deals </span><button type="button" class="inline-tag-btn">1d8+5</button><span> thunder damage; target has disadvantage against others.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Thunder Gauntlets">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">+9 / 1d8 + 5</button></div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Cast Summon Construct</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Summon Construct)</span><span class="conc-badge">CONC</span><span class="cost-badge">3rd Slot</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Spawns a linked Construct companion immediately after your initiative.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Cast Summon Construct">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">Summon</button></div></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">BONUS ACTIONS (1)</div></div><div class="forge-list-row"><div><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle); text-underline-offset: 2px;" title="Open full details in right Inspector panel"><strong>Defensive Field</strong></button> <span class="forge-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">(Guardian Thunder Gauntlets)</span><span class="cost-badge">Defensive Field</span><div class="forge-muted"><span>Gain temporary HP equal to your Artificer level.</span></div></div><div class="forge-row"><button type="button" class="btn" style="padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);" title="Pin to favorites" aria-label="Pin Defensive Field">☆</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary tabular forge-nowrap">Use</button></div></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">REACTIONS (0)</div></div><div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;">No matching actions.</div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="forge-section-label">FREE &amp; SPECIAL (0)</div></div><div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;">No matching actions.</div></section></main></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-dir